    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binary Boss</strong> is a lightning-fast Yes/No quiz built for true PC Gamers. <br>From classics to cult hits, every question tests your memory, instincts, and mastery of gaming history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000 questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Question statistics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're god-tier? Prove it\u2014Y/N?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803040/extras/06d91a378fa4f835a31b8b8aed3f6dc3.poster.avif?t=1752816699\" width=800 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803040/extras/06d91a378fa4f835a31b8b8aed3f6dc3.webm?t=1752816699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803040/extras/06d91a378fa4f835a31b8b8aed3f6dc3.mp4?t=1752816699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
